{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#card-zh","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-drag-and-drop**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把拖入 DSH Web UI 的本地文件或文件夹解析为原始路径，并写入当前会话草稿。它通过浏览器端全页拖放监听与本机宿主定位路由协作，优先查找当前和已注册工作区，再使用系统文件索引及有限目录搜索。支持多项路径逐行插入、同名候选的内容指纹比对、目录结构比对与手动选择，并在失败时显示提示。适合需要把本地代码、文档或文件夹路径交给 DSH 工具处理的 Web 用户。无需 API Key；安装到 web profile 即可使用，OS 文件索引工具可改善搜索体验。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:108-142","src/locator.ts:112-130","src/index.ts:31-47"]}
{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#card-en","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-drag-and-drop is a DSH Web bundle that inserts original local file and folder paths into the draft. When the browser hides paths, it searches workspaces and local indexes; users can choose among duplicate matches. It helps pass local paths to DSH tools and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:108-142","src/locator.ts:112-130","src/index.ts:31-47"]}
