{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#feature-1","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drag-and-drop 的功能「本地 URI 转路径」：读取拖放中的 file URI，按 POSIX、Windows 驱动器或 UNC 规则转换为本机路径，并去重后插入草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/paths.ts:12-29"]}
{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#feature-2","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drag-and-drop 的功能「本机候选搜索」：浏览器隐藏路径时，宿主按当前工作区、其他工作区和常用目录查找，并以有限递归及系统索引补足。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/locator.ts:112-130"]}
{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#feature-3","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drag-and-drop 的功能「重复文件辨认」：多个同名同大小候选时比较采样指纹，必要时比较完整指纹；仍无法区分则让用户选择路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/locator.ts:133-142"]}
{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#feature-4","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drag-and-drop 的功能「文件夹定位」：先比对目录结构，再对最多选出的文件样本计算内容摘要；仍有多个匹配时显示候选供选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/locator.ts:144-161"]}
{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#feature-5","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drag-and-drop 的功能「拖放写入会话草稿」：在全页监听文件拖放，解析到的多个路径按行追加到当前会话草稿，并对未找到项显示可关闭提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:102-142"]}
{"unit_id":"bill9109__dsh-drag-and-drop#caveat-1","repo":"bill9109/dsh-drag-and-drop","commit":"6119a2cbe3cc4267b9d0ef56df54e0c416f7a3db","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drag-and-drop 使用前须知：当浏览器隐藏路径时，定位依赖工作区、本机文件索引或有界目录搜索；搜索受候选数和遍历量限制，未命中时会提示无法定位。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/locator.ts:11-15","src/locator.ts:30-45","src/platform-search.ts:7-10"]}
